    narr:narration """This position holds a two-part rollout design: [installing sensors in all four greenhouse bays before the first frost, with the pilot unit in the bay that lost the most seedlings last winter](narr:Expr_20261013_3_Batch1Greenhouse20261013214134_h283ca213ee62_1), and [a fifteen-minute reporting cadence on the grounds that anything slower misses the overnight drop](narr:Expr_20261013_3_Batch1Greenhouse20261013214134_h283ca213ee62_3). The first is voiced as a settled plan; the second as a technical requirement following agreement.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261013_3_Batch1Greenhouse20261013214134_h283ca213ee62_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261013_3_Batch1Greenhouse20261013214134_h283ca213ee62_3> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We install humidity sensors in all four greenhouse bays before the first frost. Bay two gets the pilot unit first, because it lost the most seedlings last winter." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261013_3_Batch1Greenhouse20261013214134_h283ca213ee62_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The sensors report every fifteen minutes; anything slower misses the overnight drop." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261013_3_Batch1Greenhouse20261013214134_h283ca213ee62_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Sequencing tension: full deployment before frost sits alongside a pilot-first ordering in the same plan — which comes first is not resolved here." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261013_3_Batch1Greenhouse20261013214134_h283ca213ee62_1> ] ;
